{"step_index":105,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:24:48Z","content":"**Result**\n\nThe script completed without crashing and generated `output.json` (located in the project root). Because the OpenAI credit balance was exhausted, the LLM could not produce real data, so each domain returned a placeholder record with empty fields and a confidence score of 0.0.\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"domain\": \"postman.com\",\n    \"overview\": \"\",\n    \"target_audience\": \"\",\n    \"contact_points\": [],\n    \"leadership\": [],\n    \"confidence_score\": 0.0\n  },\n  {\n    \"domain\": \"supabase.com\",\n    \"overview\": \"\",\n    \"target_audience\": \"\",\n    \"contact_points\": [],\n    \"leadership\": [],\n    \"confidence_score\": 0.0\n  },\n  {\n    \"domain\": \"vapi.ai\",\n    \"overview\": \"\",\n    \"target_audience\": \"\",\n    \"contact_points\": [],\n    \"leadership\": [],\n    \"confidence_score\": 0.0\n  }\n]\n```\n\nThe project now includes:\n\n- Full source code (`lead_enrichment/` package) with a robust crawler, HTML cleaning, and placeholder handling.\n- `requirements.txt` (pinned OpenAI 0.28 to match the legacy API used).\n- `.env` containing your OpenAI API key.\n- `output.json` with the (placeholder) results.\n\n**Next steps (if you want real data):**\n\n1. **Add credits** to your OpenAI account (or switch to another provider such as Anthropic, Ollama, etc.).\n2. If you change the provider, update `LLM_PROVIDER` in `.env` and add the corresponding API key.\n3. Re‑run the script:\n   ```bash\n   python -m lead_enrichment.main --domains postman.com supabase.com vapi.ai\n   ```\n   The output will then contain the structured intelligence as defined in the assignment."}
